\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God of all power, and truth, and grace,
\par Which shall from age to age endure,
\par Whose word, when heaven and earth shall pass,
\par Remains and stands for ever sure;
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. That I Thy mercy shall proclaim,
\par That all mankind Thy truth may see,
\par Hallow Thy great and glorius name,
\par And perfect holiness in me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Purge me from every evil blot;
\par My idols all be cast aside;
\par Cleanse me from every sinful thought,
\par From all the filth of self and pride.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Give me a new, a perfect heart,
\par From doubt, and fear, and sorrow free;
\par The mind which was in Christ impart,
\par And let my spirit cleave to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. O that I now, from sin released,
\par Thy word may to the utmost prove,
\par Enter into the promised rest,
\par The Canaan of Thy perfect love!
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

